note PLANNED — Romit UI layer (Stage 4). Not parsed by the Stage 1 compiler.
note Shows the brace-free surface syntax for apps and screens.

app Landing
  theme dark
    background  #0a0a0a
    text        #f5f5f5
    accent      purple
    corners     rounded
    font        Inter

screen Home at /
  defaults
    padding 24
    gap 16
    align center
  nav
    text "Acme" bold
    space
    link "Features" to features
    button "Sign up"
      on click go to /signup
  hero
    text "Build faster with Acme" size 48 bold
    row
      button "Get started"
        on click go to /signup
      button "Learn more" outline
        on click scroll to features
  section features
    grid 3 columns
      card
        text "Fast" bold
        text "Pages load instantly."
  footer
    text "2026 Acme" muted
